;depth of field
DepthOfReflections1ToSee=Głãbòkòsc òdbiców: 1, bë widzec le jedno òdbicé,\nprzë 2 mòże widzec òdbicô w òdbitim òbiekce, ... i tak dali.
;Depth of reflections: 1 to see only one reflection,\nwith 2 you could see reflections in the reflected object, ... and so on.
Deriv=Deriv
