DerivDeriv2=Deriv'  =  Deriv * 2
;Deriv'  =  Deriv * 2
Description=Òpisënk
;Description
DetectsTheAmountOfProcessorCores=Rozpòznôwô lëczbã jąder procesora przë zrëszanim.\nMòże samemù wëbrac lëczbã i wëłączëc tã òpcjã,\nżebë zaczinac z jinyma nastawama.
;Detects the amount of processor cores on startup.\nYou can choose the amount yourself and disable\nthis option to start with different settings.
DeterminesHowManyFollowingObjectsDiffuse=òkresliwô, jak wiele pòsobnëch rozpròszonëch òdbiców òbiektów mdze rechòwónëch
;determines how many following objects diffuse reflections will be calculated
DeterminesHowManyFollowingStraightReflections=òkresliwô, jak wiele pòsobnëch prostëch òdbiców mdze rechòwónëch
;determines how many following straight reflections will be calculated
DeterminesWhenToStopRenderingIn=Òkresliwô, czedë zatrzëmac renderowanié w rzeszowim tribie
;Determines when to stop rendering in batch-mode
DeterminesWhetherTheLightShouldBe=Òkresliwô, czë wid mô bëc widzawny, ë jegò sztôłt.
;Determines whether the light should be visible and its shape.
Diff=Dif:
