LeftclickGoIntoMouseModeView=Lewé kliknienié:  wéńdzenié w trib mëszë.. zdrzenié mëszą, +prawi knąp mëszë.. òbrôcanié\n(Klikni znowa lewim abò ESC, żebë wińc z tribù mëszë)
;Leftclick:  go into mouse-mode.. view by mouse, +right mousebutton.. rolling\n(Leftclick again or ESC to exit the mouse-mode)
LeftclickRotateTheBulbAroundThe=Lewé klikniãcé:   Òbrôcô bulb wkół òsë X òbzérôcza @ wôrtnotë Ymid+Zmid\nPrawé klikniãcé: Òbrôcô bulb wkół òsë X òbiektu @ 0
;Leftclick:   Rotate the bulb around the viewers X axis @ Ymid+Zmid values\nRightclick: Rotate the bulb around the objects X axis @ 0
LeftclickRotateTheBulbAroundThe2=Lewé klikniãcé:   Òbrôcô bulb wkół òsë Y òbzérôcza @ wôrtnotë Xmid+Zmid\nPrawé klikniãcé: Òbrôcô bulb wkół òsë Y òbiektu @ 0
;Leftclick:   Rotate the bulb around the viewers Y axis @ Xmid+Zmid values\nRightclick: Rotate the bulb around the objects Y axis @ 0
LeftclickRotateTheBulbAroundThe3=Lewé klikniãcé:   Òbrôcô bulb wkół òsë Z òbzérôcza @ wôrtnotë Xmid+Ymid\nPrawé klikniãcé: Òbrôcô bulb wkół òsë Z òbiektu @ 0
;Leftclick:   Rotate the bulb around the viewers Z axis @ Xmid+Ymid values\nRightclick: Rotate the bulb around the objects Z axis @ 0
LeftclickUndoSetsTheLightParameter=Lewé kliknienié:   Copnij -> Nastôwiô parametrë widu na stón sprzed slédnégò malowaniô\nPrawé kliknienié: Pòwtórzë
;Leftclick:   Undo -> Sets the light parameter to the state before the last painting\nRightclick: Redo
LeftclickUndoSetsTheParameterTo=Lewé klikniãcé:   Copni -> Nastôwiô parametrë na stón przed òstatnym rechòwanim\nPrawé klikniãcé: Znowa
;Leftclick:   Undo -> Sets the parameter to the state before the last calculation\nRightclick: Redo
LetTheThresholdDecreaseTheAmbient=Pòzwôlô progòwi zmniészëc òkòlny céń do 0.\nDaleczé strukturë są mni pòd cëskã blëższich strukturów.
;Let the threshold decrease the ambient shadow down to 0.\nFar structures are less affected by nearer structures.
