MakeAnImageSelectionWithThe=Zaznaczë mëszą òbrëmié òbrôzka, pòtemù wërechùj ten wëbiér na nowò\nz terôczasnyma parametrama.\nCwiardé cénie ë DEAO bãdą téż wërechòwóné, jeżlë wëbróné, ale\njinszé òkòlné cénie mùszą bëc wërechòwóné na nowò dlô całégò òbrôzka.\nTéż "normalné na Zbuffer" mùszą bëc wërechòwóné na nowò, jeżlë bëłë rëchli rechòwóné.
;Make an image selection with the mouse then recalculate this selection\nwith the current parameters.\nThe hardshadows and the DEAO will also be calculated if selected, but\nother ambient shadows must be recalculated again for the whole image.\nAlso "normals on Zbuffer" has to be recalculated, if calculated before.
MakeSureThatNoLightWill=Zagwësniwô, że w tribie bez mieszaniô żóden wid nie bãdze òdjimóny
;Make sure that no light will be subtracted in non-blend mode
MakeSureThatTheCalcAutomatic=Zagwësni sã, że òptacje 'Rechùj... aùtomatno' dlô cwiardëch\në òkòlnëch céniów są nastawioné, jeżlë chcesz je ùwzglãdnic.
;Make sure that the 'Calc... automatic.' options for the hard\nand ambient shadows are set, if you wish to consider them.
MakeTheTopBottomGradientOf=Robi gradient góra-dół farwów òkòlégò widu ë spòdla\nwzglãdnym do ùkładu kòòrdinatów òbiektu.\nBrëkùj tegò w animacjach, żebë przëwiązac widë do scenerii.
;Make the top-bottom gradient of the ambient and background colors\nrelative to the objects coordinate system.\nUse it in animations to fix the lights to the scenery.
MakesReflectionsALittleDiffuseValue=Robi òdbicô përznã rozpròszoné, wôrtnotë òd 0 do 2.5
;Makes reflections a little diffuse, value range from 0 to 2.5
MakingTheVideo=Ùsôdzanié wideò...
