OptionToCalculateOnlyAPart=Òptacja rechòwaniô leno dzélu òbrôzka dlô chùtszégò pòdzérkù.\nPrzed rechòwanim zaznaczë mëszą òbrëmié na òbrôzkù.
;Option to calculate only a part of the image for a faster preview.\nMake a selection in the image with the mouse before calculating.
OptionToDitherTheAngleOf=Òptacja ditheringù nórta parmieniów dlô skalowaniô òbrôzka 1:2 abò 1:3.\nTo dôwô wikszą precyzjã ë mni plamiastëch artefaktów.\nBôczënk: brëkùj leno przë tim samim skalowanim òbrôzka, jinaczi dostóniesz artefaktë ditheringù.
;Option to dither the angle of rays for an image scaling of 1:2 or 1:3.\nThis leads to more precision and less spotty artifacts.\nCaution: use only on the same image scaling, else you get dither artifacts.
