ScaleClipRadiusDoFAndTheDE=Skalëje ClipRadius (DoF) i wôrtnotã DE stop,\nżebë ùtrzëmac stãpiéń detalów i farwë.
;Scale ClipRadius (DoF) and the DE stop value\nto keep the detail level and colors.
