;Strength
StrengthOfDynamicFog=Mòc dinamiczny dôczi.
;Strength of dynamic fog.
StretchesUpperAndLowerPartsMaybe=Rozcygô górné ë dólné partie, mòże przëdatné dlô zwëczajnégò òbrôzka w òptacji fùl kùlë.
;Stretches upper and lower parts, maybe useful for a common image in full sphere option.
SubframeCountMultiplicator=Mnożnik lëczbë\npòdklatków:
;Subframe count\nmultiplicator:
SubframeInterpolation=Interpòlacjô pòdklatków:
;Subframe interpolation:
SubframesToRender=Pòdklatczi do renderowaniô
;Subframes to render
SubframesToRenderBetween=Pòdklatczi do  \nrenderowaniô midzë:
;Subframes to  \nrender between:
SubtractAnAmountOfDEstopFrom=Òdjimô dzél DEstop òd nastãpnégò krokù parminia, zalécóné przë wësoczich wôrtnotach DEstop.
;Subtract an amount of DEstop from next raystep, recommended on high DEstop values.
SupportNetworkRendering=Wspiarcé renderowaniô w sécë
;Support network rendering
SupportedMathematicalFunctions=Wspieróné matematiczné fùnkcje
;Supported mathematical functions
SurfaceColor=Farwa pòwiérzchni
;Surface color
SurfaceDetail=Detale pòwiérzchni:
;Surface detail:
Swarm=Rój
;Swarm
SwarmABlockOnEveryComputer=rój: blok na kòżdim kòmpùtrze, jaż do Stop
;swarm: a block on every computer, until Stop
SwarmBlocksOfRaysPixel=rój: {} blokòw pò {} parmieni/piksel
;swarm: {} blocks of {} rays/pixel
SwarmComputer=rój: {} kòmpùtr
;swarm: {} computer
SwarmComputers=rój: {} kòmpùtrów
;swarm: {} computers
SwarmCreatingTheJob=rój: twòrzenié robòtë
;swarm: creating the job
SwarmJob=robòta roju
;swarm job
SwarmLower=rój: {}
;swarm: {}
SwarmRenderingSharedBetweenYourComputers=Rój: renderowanié dzeloné midzë Waszima kòmpùtrama
;Swarm: rendering shared between your computers
SwitchBackToTheDefaultTheme=Wrôcô nazôd do domëslny témë
;Switch back to the default theme
TargetMapSlot=Docelowi slot mapë
;Target Map Slot
TargetMapSlotUseThisNumber=Docelowi slot mapë. Ùżij ti lëczbë jakno mapë w swòjim fraktalu, np. jakno mapë wësokòscë, żebë miec animòwóną mapã
;Target Map Slot. Use this number as map in your fractal, e. g. as heightmap, in order to have an animated map
TheAmountOfAddedDiffuseAnd=Wielosc dodónëch rozproszonëch ë spekùlarnëch farwów je wikszô jak 1,\nczë je zmniészëc dlô realisticzniészégò farwieniô?
;The amount of added diffuse and specular colors are bigger 1,\nshould i downscale them for a more realistic coloring?
TheAnimationNeedsAtLeastTwo=Animacjô pòtrzebùje nômni dwùch kluczowëch klatków.
;The animation needs at least two keyframes.
TheApertureOnTheZsharpPoint=Apertura w pùnkce Zsharp, to nie je apertura kamerë!\nPòmnożë tã wôrtnosc przez (swòbódno wëbróną) òdległosc òd pùnktu Zsharp\ndo kamerë ë pòdzelë przez ògniskòwą dłużawã òbiektiwu kamerë, żebë dostac\naperturã kamerë.\nTej zmniészë tã wôrtnosc, jeżlë nie żdajesz tak wiôldżi kamerë.\nWikszé wôrtnoscë dôwają wicy rozmazaniô.
;The aperture on the Zsharp point, it is not the aperture from the camera!\nMultply this value with the (free choosen) distance from the Zsharp point\nto the camera and divide it by the focal length of the cameras lense to get\nthe cameras aperture.\nSo downscale this value if you don't expect the cameras size that big.\nLarger values means more blur.
TheBTracer2CacheFormatIsNot=Fòrmat cache BTracer2 nie je wspieróny przez nen program.\nWëbierzë fòrmat sécë (*.ply abò *.obj).
;The BTracer2 cache format is not supported by this program.\nPlease choose a mesh format (*.ply or *.obj).
TheBTracer2CacheFormatIsNot2=Fòrmat cache BTracer2 nie je wspieróny, séc nie òsta zapisónô.
;The BTracer2 cache format is not supported, the mesh was not saved.
TheBackgroundImageCouldNotBe=Nie dało sã wczëtac òbrôzka spòdla.
;The background image could not be loaded.
TheBailoutValueForEscapetimeFormulas=Wôrtnota bailout dlô fòrmùłów escapetime.\nJeżlë wôrtnota 3d przekroczi tã wôrtnotã òb czas iterowaniô,\nbieżny pùnkt nie nôleżi do òbiektu.
;The bailout value for escapetime formulas.\nIf the 3d value exceeds this value while iterating,\nthe current point does not belong to the object.
TheBlurRadiusWillBeLimited=Radius rozmazaniô bãdze ògrańczony do ti wôrtnoscë.\nMòże przërëchlëc renderowanié, czej radius w niechtërnëch dzélach òbrôzka robi sã baro wiôldżi.
;The blur radius will be limited at this value.\nCan speedup rendering when the radius becomes very huge in some image parts.
TheCalculationFailed=Rechòwanié sã nie ùdało: {}
;The calculation failed: {}
TheCalculationFailedLower=rechòwanié sã nie ùdało
;the calculation failed
TheCalculationWillBeExtendedTowards=Rechòwanié bãdze rozszérzoné bùten òbrôzka ò òdbité òbiektë.\nTo mòże dac mni artefaktów w animacjach, ale téż stojącé òbrôzczi mògą na tim zwëskac.\nWôrtnosc mô bëc w òbrëmienim òd 0 do 0.5 (maks 0.9), to je wiôlgòsc wzglãdno szérzë\në wësokòscë òbrôzka, jakô je maksymalno rechòwónô bùten.
;The calculation will be extended towards the outside the image with reflected objects.\nThis might lead to less artifacts in animations, but stills can profit from it too.\nValue should be in the range of 0 to 0.5 (max 0.9), it is the size relative to the image\nwidth and height that is maximal calculated on the outside.
TheDefaultNumberingIncludes2Numbers=Domëslné numrowanié mô 2 lëczbë, òddzelno dlô X ë Y.\nCzej wëbierze sã tã òptacjã, numrowanié mô le jedną lëczbã,\nrosnącą w kòżdi kòlumnie ë jidącą dali w pòsobny rédze.
;The default numbering includes 2 numbers, seperated in X and Y.\nIf you choose this option, the numbering is only one number,\nincreasing in each column and follows on the next row.
TheDefaultOutputIsWhiteFor=Domëslno òbiekt je biôłi, a òbéńda bùten czôrnô.\nTa òptacjô òdwrôcô farwë.
;The default output is white for the object and black for the outside area.\nChoose this option to invert the colors.
TheDistanceEstimatesAreDownscaledBy=Szacënczi òdległoscë są skalowóné w dół tim faktorã, żebë ùniknąc przekroczeniô.\nZmniészë wôrtnotã, jeżlë pòjawiô sã przekroczenié (czôrné piksle, zaszëmiony òbrôzk).\nZa niższé wôrtnotë spòmalają renderowanié.
;The distance estimates are downscaled by this factor to avoid overstepping.\nReduce the value if overstepping occurs (black pixels, noisy image).\nToo low values slows the rendering down.
TheDistanceEstimatesAreDownscaledBy2=Szacënczi òddaleniô są zmniészóné ò ten mnożnik, żebë ùniknąc przekroczeniô.\nZmniészë wôrtnotã, żelë wëstãpùje przekroczenié (czôrné piksle, szum na òbrôzkù).\nZa môłé wôrtnotë spòwòlniwają renderowanié.
;The distance estimates are downscaled by this factor to avoid overstepping.\nReduce the value if overstepping occurs (black pixels, noisy image).\nToo low values slows the rendering down .
TheDistanceToTheObjectsSurface=Òdległosc òd pòwiérzchni òbiektu, przë jaczi raymarching sã kùńczi, bãdze wikszô z òdległoscą òd òbzérôcza.\nTo dôwô jednorodny wëzdrzatk òbiektu, tej je zwëczajno wëbiéróné.
;The distance to the objects surface, the raymarching stops, will get bigger with the distance to the viewer.\nThis leads to a homogen object appearence, so it is normally choosen.
TheEffectAccumulatesResetForA=Efekt sã zbiérô, wëzerëj dlô nowégò rechòwaniô.
;The effect accumulates, reset for a new calculation.
TheFileM3fAlreadyExistsDo=Lopk <{}.m3f> ju je. Czë chcesz gò nadpisac?
;The file <{}.m3f> already exists. Do you want to overwrite it?
TheFirstFocusPointTheValue=(Pierszi) pùnkt òstroscë.\nWôrtnosc je wzglãdno wôrtnoscë Zstart òbzérôcza,\nznormalizowónô do szérzë òbrôzka.
;The (first) focus point.\nThe value is relative to the viewers Zstart value,\nnormalized to the imagewidth.
TheFolderDoesNotExistOr=katalog nie je (abò nie je przëstãpny)
;the folder does not exist (or is not reachable)
TheFormulaNameShouldStartWith=Miono fòrmùłë pòwinno sã zaczënac òd "JIT", bë òdrozniwac te fòrmùłë òd fòrmùłów na spòdlim ASM
;The formula name should start with "JIT" in order to distinguish those formulas from the ASM-based formulas
TheFramesPerSecondMustBe=Klatczi na sekùndã mùszą bëc lëczbą wikszą jak 0 (np. 25).
;The frames per second must be a number above 0 (e.g. 25).
TheImageBufferHasTheWrong=bùfer òbrôzka mô lëchą wiôlgòsc
;the image buffer has the wrong size
TheImageSizeChangedCalculateThe=wiôlgòsc òbrôzka sã zmieniła: wërechùj òbrôzk znowa
;the image size changed: calculate the image again
TheItsTrapModeDependsOn=Trib its.trap zanôlégô òd wërechòwóny òptacji w karce "Farwienié".
;The its.trap mode depends on the calculated option in the "Coloring" tab.
TheMainEditorIsStillRendering=Przédny editor wcyg renderëje. Nôprzód gò zatrzëmôj abò żdżë, jaż skùńczi.
;The main editor is still rendering. Please stop it first or wait until it is done.
TheMapOptionsCalculatesXY=Òpcje mapë rechùją kòòrdinatë x,y z òsoblëwégò\nwektora dlô sfericznëch mapów, to zmieniwô téż pierszi wëbiér farwë,\njaczi zwëczajno òpiérô sã na głôdczich iteracjach.\nŻebë widzec wënik zmianów tëch òpcjów,\nnót je òbrôzk wërechòwac znowa.
;The map options calculates x,y coordinates from the specific\nvector for spherical maps, this changes also the first color choice\nthat is usually based on smooth iterations.\nYou have to recalculate the image to see the result of this\noptions changes.
TheMonteCarloWindowIsRendering=Òkno Monte Carlo renderëje: nôprzód je zatrzëmôj.
;The Monte Carlo window is rendering: stop it first.
TheNameOfTheNewLanguage=Miono nowégò jãzëka, w tim jãzëkù (Deutsch, Polski, ...)
;The name of the new language, in that language (Deutsch, Polski, ...)
TheNewestJobSoFarRendered=Nônowszô robòta donëchczôs: wërenderowóné dzélë, dzélë w robòce (z jich pòstãpã), felëjącé dzélë
;The newest job so far: rendered parts, parts under way (with their progress), missing parts
TheParametersDoNotMatchThe=Parametrë ju nie pasëją do nieskùńczonégò rechòwaniô: wcësni "Rechùj 3D", bë je wërechòwac.
;The parameters do not match the unfinished calculation any more: press "Calculate 3D" to calculate them.
ThePictureDoesNotMatchIts=Òbrôzk nie pasëje do swòjégò rechòwaniô: wërechùj gò znowa.
;The picture does not match its calculation: calculate it again.
TheRotationIsPerformedAroundThe=Òbrôcanié je wëkònywóné wkół strzódka (Xmid, Ymid, Zmid)
;The rotation is performed around the Midpoint (Xmid, Ymid, Zmid)
TheRotationsArePerformedInA=Òbrotë są wëkònywóné pò se, nôprzód w płaszczëznie XW, na kùńcu ZW.
;The rotations are performed in a row, first the XW, last the ZW-plane.
TheSelectionMustBeBiggerThan=Wëbiérk mùszi bëc wikszi jak 2 piksle w szérzi ë wësokòscë.
;The selection must be bigger than 2 pixels in width and height.
TheSelectionMustBeBiggerThanLower=wëbiérk mùszi bëc wikszi jak 2 piksle w szérzi ë wësokòscë
;the selection must be bigger than 2 pixels in width and height
TheSharedFolderOfTheSwarm=Dzelony katalog roju
;The shared folder of the swarm
TheStereoEyeImagesHaveDifferent=Òbrôzczi òczów stereo mają różné wiôlgòscë.
;The stereo eye images have different sizes.
TheTileHasNoImageBuffer=kachel ni mô bùfra òbrôzka
;the tile has no image buffer
Themes=Témë
