ThereIsAFileAlready=Lopk {} ju je.
;There is a file {} already.
ThisComputer=Nen kòmpùtr:
;This computer:
ThisEffectIsAccumulatedOnEach=Ten efekt zbiérô sã z kòżdim nacësniãcym knąpë, mòżesz gò wëzerowac knąpą\n'Wëzerëj' - ale òdbicô bãdą téż copniãté!
;This effect is accumulated on each button press, you can reset by pressing\nthe 'Reset' button - but reflections would also be undone!
ThisFileAlreadyExistsDoYou=Nen lopk ju je. Czë gwësno chcesz gò nadpisac?
;This file already exists. Do you really want to overwrite it?
ThisIsAAbsoluteOffsetIn=To je absolutné przesëniãcé w czerënkù x òbróconégò bulba.
